# Summary

The handbook states that vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook [[cite:obs-3f4b258ad0e7092dc97274f1c3b0d99855e8cc28 "Vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook."]].

The appendix specifies that bays twelve through thirty are blocked for supplier vans only, with a midday deadline [[cite:obs-3ccb6c7b307553033773f243afd32e582177b103 "Bays twelve through thirty: blocked, supplier vans only, midday deadline."]].

This indicates that these spaces are reserved and have a time limit for parking.
